#migration_cmd
npm run typeorm:cli -- migration:generate src/migration/admin
npm run typeorm_tenant:cli -- migration:generate src/migration/tenanted

For Admin Database:
npm run typeorm:cli -- migration:run

Update:
npm run typeorm:cli -- migration:generate src/migration/admin/update-question-entity

npm run typeorm:cli -- migration:generate src/migration/admin/update-question-entity


For Tenant Database:
# IMPORTANT: You must set TENANT_SCHEMA environment variable before running tenant migrations
# Example: TENANT_SCHEMA=tenent_123 npm run typeorm_tenant:cli -- migration:run

npm run tenant_migrations_all --> for all tenants update 

Update:
npm run typeorm_tenant:cli -- migration:generate src/migration/tenanted/add-disclosure-entity

